WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.100
Ryu blocks Marisa’s standing LP.

2
00:00:01.100 --> 00:00:02.150
Marisa guards the recorded OD Shoryuken.

3
00:00:02.150 --> 00:00:03.250
Held standing HP punishes Ryu’s recovery.

4
00:00:03.250 --> 00:00:04.200
Forward HK links into OD Quadriga.

5
00:00:04.200 --> 00:00:04.900
OD Quadriga wall-bounces Ryu.

6
00:00:04.900 --> 00:00:06.900
Forward MP and its heavy-kick target continue the juggle.

7
00:00:06.900 --> 00:00:08.800
The performed unheld Level 1 Super completes the corner punish.
